 "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619602_1632624711811444_7917820958400638745_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_A1JQO3NCWgQ7kNvwHSnMJp&_nc_oc=AdrpAZY3OBetBMh5prv4G2KPiS0lhtgkdxAAa_lvfogIFvR__vI3KeLF9OCvnTZ_oPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSPaM1N_R2Tb5wYEZ6-59jVFflN1qbs2NtlKHC9b5l38Q&oe=6AEDFC28"}, {"file_name": "05-model-library.png", "id": "1796838868114473", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593714175_1796838871447806_5007697798046078525_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fin2mW6IGkMQ7kNvwEQqMnO&_nc_oc=Adr_FLWeuBB9yp7mbY1MgTyXtyoqzIxX0C0AiuVseZcMaz4i17AFK5L80KRdeTUgla4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_QUuAh9unYzD5cFdq4h7nSRwvHL91PiOSx2k8wd4SWA&oe=6AEDFFAE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "locally", "keywords": ["offline", "productivity", "local", "voice", "ai"], "long_description": "**Your AI. Right here.**\n\nlocally brings local AI to Meta Quest 3 and 3S in a multitasking panel. Draft text, explore ideas, and ask questions with AI running on your headset.\n\n- **Get started:** a guided tour starts Gemma's background download, with progress and cancellation controls. Choose Gemma or lighter Qwen models, then chat offline.\n- **Use vision:** attach photos, or opt in to letting a vision-capable model request a photo to answer your question.\n- **Multilingual talk and listen:** dictate with live transcription in selectable languages. Hear replies as they arrive.\n- **Use tools:** calculate, check date/time, and optionally read public web pages or feeds by URL, with source links.\n- **Make it yours:** save instructions, context size, thinking, and tool permissions per model. View streamed thoughts when supplied by the model.\n- **Stay organized:** read Markdown replies with lists, code and tables; revisit or delete chats; view token counts and response benchmarks.\n\nAI and speech run locally. History stays on your device when enabled. No separate locally account is needed. Microphone, camera, and web access are optional.\n\nDownloads need internet and storage. Web reading sends requested URLs to websites; it is not a search engine and some pages cannot be read. Speed and features vary by model; speech can slow replies. AI can be wrong: check important information.\n\n**Note:** GPU Acceleration and Vision are not supported on Quest 2 and Quest Pro devices.", "short_description": "Local AI for Meta Quest 3 and 3S. Chat offline with Gemma or Qwen, dictate messages, hear spoken replies, and ask about photos. Use calculator and date/time tools, or opt in to reading public web pages. Enjoy Markdown replies, visible thoughts, and settings saved for each model. AI processing stays on your headset; downloads and web access need internet. Multilingual chat and dictation (speech availability varies by language)."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://uralstech.in/privacy-policy-locally", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "URAV ADVANCED LEARNING SYSTEMS PVT LTD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://uralstech.in/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "4593990050886590"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_squ